      "data": {
        "label": "Meridian Rail — IT landscape (layered/domain view) — PROTOTYPE\n\nAn enterprise architect's survey of the same estate as the flat landscape (#1), restructured as a drill-down: one shape per business domain here, each linking down to a sub-diagram of that domain's individual services. Only \"Ticketing & Booking\" is built so far, as a proof of concept — the other 9 domains from #1's businessDomain tag are planned but not yet added. Compare against the flat version to see the same content two different ways: everything-at-once vs. drill-down-by-domain.\n\nPart of the Meridian Rail example gallery — epic 0022 (docs/planning/epics/0022-example-diagram-gallery.md)."
      }
    },
